Cell["\<\
Baikov: a package for generating Baikov representations for a given Feynman \
integral family.
Version: 1.1.0
If you come across any problem, please contact phamapku14@gmail.com 
BaikovLetter: a package for analysing singularity for all kinds of families \
and 
 generating candidate rational letters and algebraic letters for families \
which belong to MPL functions.\
\>", "Print",
